        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions MDS04, Rope Madison Door Handle with Oversized Ball Finials</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Madison Series 4 Door Handle features a roped grip and over-sized ball ends for a unique look that is perfect for grand entrances. This door pull is made to last so, although it is great for home use, it can also stand up to demanding commercial applications as well. The Madison Rope Pull with Ball Finials is available in 25-1/2 inch and 30 inch lengths. Choose from surface mounted, back-to-back mounted, and thru-bolt mounted.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 4 Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions MDS04 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-MDS04025:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 25-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-MDS04030:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls.</b>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Madison Rope Pull with Ball Finials",
                "description": "The Madison Series 4 Door Handle features a roped grip and over-sized ball ends for a unique look that is perfect for grand entrances. This door pull is made to last so, although it is great for home use, it can also stand up to demanding commercial applications as well. The Madison Rope Pull with Ball Finials is available in 25-1/2 inch and 30 inch lengths. Choose from surface mounted, back-to-back mounted, and thru-bolt mounted.",
